stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> saved_valid: Keep a valid draft
  saved_valid --> corrected: Select and review
  [*] --> restored_invalid_date: Load a stored impossible date
  restored_invalid_date --> review_required: Select draft, retain sentence and show original date
  review_required --> review_required: File or keep without correcting, nothing sent
  review_required --> corrected: Choose a valid date
  corrected --> removed: File successfully with the verified account
  review_required --> actor_invalidated: Account changes, hide previous text
  corrected --> actor_invalidated: Account changes
  actor_invalidated --> saved_valid: Verified account loads its own drafts
  removed --> [*]
  %% never File while the saved date still requires review
